{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48313","headline":"咏安仁宰捣蒜 · 蒋贻恭","name":"咏安仁宰捣蒜","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"安仁县令好诛求，百姓脂膏满面流。\n半破磁缸成醋酒，死牛肠肚作馒头。\n帐生岁取餐三顿，乡老盘庚犯五瓯。\n半醉半醒齐出县，共伤涂炭不胜愁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"蒋贻恭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48313.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48313","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}